<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fruitfed yr net profit falls 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Fruitfed yr net profit falls 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.1 vs 1.4</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    5.0 vs 8.5</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  8.9 vs 11.9</p>
<p>    Turnover				    57.9 vs 64.2</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				1.5 vs 2.1</p>
<p>    Tax					    0.4 vs 0.7</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  12.0 vs 12.0</p>
<p>Note - Fruitfed Supplies is a fruit and vegetable distributor.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
